{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13359","headline":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗 · 崔何","name":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝景西溪寺，连延近郭山。\n高深清扃外，行止翠微间。\n江澈烟尘静，川源草树闲。\n中丞健步到，柱史捷书还。\n一战清戎越，三吴变险艰。\n功名麟阁上，得咏入秦关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}